his blood replaced.

1479
00:54:22,400 --> 00:54:23,533
- Okay, Mario?

1480
00:54:23,567 --> 00:54:24,700
- Si.

1481
00:54:24,733 --> 00:54:26,067
- Okay.

1482
00:54:26,067 --> 00:54:27,367
