1488
00:54:40,500 --> 00:54:42,167
Bad shrew, bad shrew!

1489
00:54:45,200 --> 00:54:47,400
Little puppy?
(suspenseful music)

1490
00:54:47,433 --> 00:54:48,533
Little puppy?

1491
00:54:50,100 --> 00:54:50,867
Puppy?

1492
00:54:50,900 --> 00:54:53,900
(suspenseful music)

1493
00:54:55,567 --> 00:54:59,767
- Little puppy.
(suspenseful music)

1494
00:55:01,267 --> 00:55:02,700
- [Crow] Ahh, those shrews know

1495
00:55:02,733 --> 00:55:04,800
they're supposed
to close the door!

1496
00:55:04,833 --> 00:55:05,867
- [Joel] Now, let's see.

1497
00:55:05,900 --> 00:55:07,067
I'd better finish up those pies

1498
00:55:07,100 --> 00:55:08,167
before the shrews get them.

1499
00:55:08,200 --> 00:55:12,100
Sure is taste-tempting,
all those yummy pies.

1500
00:55:13,100 --> 00:55:16,100
(suspenseful music)

1501
00:55:19,067 --> 00:55:20,300
- [Tom Servo] Okay, right
over left, then left,

1502
00:55:20,333 --> 00:55:23,067
no, no, you've
got a granny knot!

1503
00:55:25,167 --> 00:55:27,367
(knocking)

1504
00:55:27,400 --> 00:55:28,700
- [Mario] Senor, it is Mario.

1505
00:55:28,733 --> 00:55:30,633
- [Crow] Oh, sir, pull
up the covers, please.

1506
00:55:30,667 --> 00:55:34,567
(Mario speaking
foreign language)

1507
00:55:34,600 --> 00:55:35,833
- A shrew in the cellar?

1508
00:55:35,867 --> 00:55:38,067
- Si, I hear him
singing down there.

1509
00:55:38,067 --> 00:55:39,067
- [Joel] He was singing?

1510
00:55:39,067 --> 00:55:40,200
- How did he get in?

1511
00:55:40,233 --> 00:55:42,133
- (speaking foreign
language) the kitchen window,

1512
00:55:42,167 --> 00:55:43,167
but I closed it off.

1513
00:55:43,200 --> 00:55:44,067
He went down there.

1514
00:55:44,100 --> 00:55:45,467
- Why should he go down there?

1515
00:55:45,500 --> 00:55:47,700
- The food for the little
(speaking foreign language).

1516
00:55:47,733 --> 00:55:49,700
(speaking foreign language)

1517
00:55:49,733 --> 00:55:50,967
- [Joel] What was
that about cojones?

1518
00:55:51,067 --> 00:55:51,700
- Did you tell Jerry?

1519
00:55:51,733 --> 00:55:52,500
- No, senor.

1520
00:55:52,533 --> 00:55:53,833
It is your turn next.

1521
00:55:53,867 --> 00:55:55,133
Here is (speaking
foreign language.

1522
00:55:55,167 --> 00:55:56,167
We kill him, no?

1523
00:55:56,200 --> 00:55:58,067
- [Crow] Oh, flashlight!

1524
00:55:58,100 --> 00:56:00,667
That's what he's trying to say!

1525
00:56:02,700 --> 00:56:05,700
- [Joel] It's Dave
Lennox and Dave Lennox

1526
00:56:05,733 --> 00:56:07,067
in The Lint Trap!

1527
00:56:11,700 --> 00:56:14,233
- [Tom Servo] Honey,
we're at Grandpa's, dear.

1528
00:56:14,267 --> 00:56:15,467
Wake up.

1529
00:56:15,500 --> 00:56:17,067
- [Joel] Man, I don't
mean to be rude,

1530
00:56:17,100 --> 00:56:18,467
but your eyes look like
two pee holes in the snow.

1531
00:56:18,500 --> 00:56:19,500
- [Crow] Soccer team!

1532
00:56:19,533 --> 00:56:21,067
- It's down in the cellar.

1533
00:56:21,067 --> 00:56:22,700
And we're going down after him.

1534
00:56:22,733 --> 00:56:24,800
But I don't want you to
let anybody open that door

1535
00:56:24,833 --> 00:56:25,800
